    "section": "Limits on Employer Control",
    "text": "Limits on Employer Control\nThe scope and exercise of employer control are limited only by specific exceptions or conditions imposed by law.\nThese include laws regulating terms and conditions of employment and laws protecting against discharge or other adverse employment action for particular reasons.",
